{"game": "alien-swarm", "language": "english", "appid": 630, "month": "2012-06", "window": 3, "start_date": 1339804800, "end_date": 1340409599, "month_true_total": 37, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-06 00:54:14 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "5659782", "author": {"steamid": "76561198053687157", "personaname": "Demented", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Demented77/", "num_games_owned": 531, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 1937, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1768, "last_played": 1452464978, "avatar": "31767b3a0307dda33cfa5eb61d54375c9a82387e"}, "language": "english", "review": "Amazing game, the co-op is amazing, and it is quite realistic. The weapon combinations are  GENIUS!!!", "timestamp_created": 1340347880, "timestamp_updated": 1340347880, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "1995022", "author": {"steamid": "76561198000719665", "personaname": "Zorp the Surveyor", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/JoshIsZorp/", "num_games_owned": 472, "num_reviews": 18, "playtime_forever": 2603, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2023, "last_played": 1635385218, "avatar": "a5fe0ff891bd94c580e229415e7394db6c33b3d5"}, "language": "english", "review": "Possibly the most fun co-op I've ever played. Absolute blast, top-down, squad based action shooter. Fun weapons, tons of carnage, and good maps. Teamwork is a must to succeed, and even the strangers I\"ve played with have been good guys. Also, can't beat the price: FREE!", "timestamp_created": 1340242030, "timestamp_updated": 1340242030, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "3376882", "author": {"steamid": "76561198021697573", "personaname": "DopestDope", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/dopestdopeever/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 1233, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 984, "last_played": 1582499081, "avatar": "0556278491bb39bf9fe6a8696c066960cca56cdd"}, "language": "english", "review": "Best game i've played in a while.", "timestamp_created": 1340222304, "timestamp_updated": 1340222304, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "3818189", "author": {"steamid": "76561198027784531", "personaname": "Cinetyk", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Cinetyk/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 51, "playtime_forever": 914, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 914, "last_played": 1358409600, "avatar": "d82c58445671767a10e07b7fa9bb0444b6ee9d05"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is a very  good and fun game to play with your friends! Heavily inspired by the \n2nd Aliens movie, it takes all the best from that sci-fi Aliens-like lore. The execution of the game's storyline and gameplay elements is just brilliant. There are 4 well designed classes of marines, each with its strengths and weakenesses, so the game inuitively encourages the co-op of 4 friends: as you play and work together you will feel engaged and rewarded for cooperating and coordinating with each other. The campaign has a good pace and a nice variety of objectives and situations. There's also lots of weapons and items to unlock as you level up. There are some really nice touches, like being able to draw on the mission map with your mouse, either in the briefing or during missions, to help plan and coordinate strategies, or reviewing your performance after a mission with different charts. Connecting your friends together in the same game is effortless via the main menu. Amazing game!", "timestamp_created": 1340066750, "timestamp_updated": 1340066750, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "3455806", "author": {"steamid": "76561198023049656", "personaname": "Saucyy", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/TanV/", "num_games_owned": 54, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 3598, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3168, "last_played": 1482363328, "avatar": "ee5cc428258a2f7f5775ae66f8bbcde744738e44"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is my second game is i vey like ! 2nd before is Team Fortress 2 is 1st", "timestamp_created": 1339989869, "timestamp_updated": 1339989869, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}]}